    "spoiler_hide_label": "Collapse review",
    "spoiler_review": "I have been using this laptop for about three months now, mostly for software development and occasional photo editing. The keyboard has a surprisingly comfortable amount of travel for such a thin chassis, and the trackpad is large and accurate without being in the way while typing. Battery life comfortably covers a full workday of mixed use, including a couple of hours of video calls. The display gets bright enough to work outdoors and the color accuracy is good enough for my photo work after a quick calibration. My only real complaints are the limited port selection, which forces me to carry a small hub, and the fan noise under sustained heavy load. Overall, I would happily recommend it to anyone who values portability over raw performance.",
